---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Industrial Control Products | Nubelon Technology" description="Industrial control components, PLC, HMI and networking requirements for Middle East projects.">
  <header class="nav"><div class="wrap nav-inner"><a class="logo" href="/Nubelon/">NUBE<span>LON</span></a><nav class="nav-links"><a href="/Nubelon/products/">Products</a><a href="/Nubelon/services/">Services</a><a href="/Nubelon/brands/">Brands</a><a class="btn" href="/Nubelon/contact/">Request a Quote</a></nav></div></header>
  <main><section class="hero"><div class="wrap"><div class="eyebrow">Product category</div><h1>Industrial<br/>control.</h1><p>PLC, HMI, control, relay, drive and networking requirements, organized for project conversations.</p><a class="btn" href="/Nubelon/contact/">Ask about a product ↗</a></div></section>
  <section><div class="wrap category-intro"><img class="category-image" src="/Nubelon/images/generated/nubelon-plc-hmi.png" alt="AI concept image for industrial control"/><div><div class="eyebrow">Control layer</div><h2>Connect the<br/>control system.</h2><p>Start with the control architecture, interface and networking requirements. Exact brands, models, documentation and regional availability will be confirmed for each enquiry.</p><a class="text-link" href="/Nubelon/contact/">Discuss a control requirement →</a></div></div></section>
  <section class="band"><div class="wrap"><div class="section-head"><div><div class="eyebrow">Typical requirements</div><h2>From PLC<br/>to plant floor.</h2></div><p>Capability groupings help structure the buying conversation; they are not a confirmed stock list.</p></div><div class="cards"><article class="card"><span class="num">01</span><h3>PLC and HMI</h3><p>Controller, visualization and operator interface requirements.</p></article><article class="card"><span class="num">02</span><h3>Relays and contactors</h3><p>Control, switching and interface components for panels and machines.</p></article><article class="card"><span class="num">03</span><h3>Drives and networking</h3><p>Motor control, industrial communication and system connectivity.</p></article></div></div></section>
  <section class="contact"><div class="wrap"><div class="eyebrow" style="color:#fff">Need a specific part?</div><h2 class="contact-title">Send a part number or BOM.</h2><p>Our sales team will confirm the right product conversation for your project and region.</p><a class="btn" href="/Nubelon/contact/">Start an enquiry ↗</a></div></section></main>
  <footer><div class="wrap footer-row"><span>Nubelon Technology (Xiamen) Co., Ltd.</span><span>Industrial Control</span><span>nubelon@163.com</span></div></footer>
</BaseLayout>
<style>.nav-inner{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;width:100%}.category-intro{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.1fr 1fr;gap:64px;align-items:center}.category-image{width:100%;height:360px;object-fit:cover;border:1px solid var(--line)}.category-intro h2{font:600 clamp(32px,4vw,52px)/1 'Space Grotesk';letter-spacing:-.05em;margin:16px 0}.category-intro p{color:var(--muted);line-height:1.7;max-width:480px}.text-link{display:inline-block;margin-top:20px;font-weight:700}.contact-title{font:600 clamp(38px,5vw,68px)/1 'Space Grotesk';letter-spacing:-.06em;max-width:700px;margin:18px 0}@media(max-width:760px){.category-intro{display:block}.category-image{height:240px;margin-bottom:35px}}</style>
